        },
        {
          "q": "Find the point(s) on the curve $y = x^3 - 3x$ where the tangent line is horizontal.",
          "answer": "$y'=3x^2-3=0$ gives $x=\\pm1$. Points: $(1,-2)$ and $(-1,2)$.",
